# ~/.config/fd/ignore — search-time ignore list.
#
# Honored automatically by `fd` (and therefore Telescope find_files /
# smart_open in Neovim). Also passed to `rg` as --ignore-file by
# Telescope's live_grep. Does NOT affect git.
#
# Syntax: gitignore-format. One pattern per line. Lines starting with
# `#` are comments. Edit with `<leader>fi` from inside Neovim.
#
# Escape hatches when you *do* want to see ignored files:
#   <leader>fF  Find files including ignored
#   <leader>fG  Live grep including ignored
#
# Add patterns below this line:
.git/
